Please rephrase it in paraphs form and more detailed: 

In view of the detailed factual and legal position articulated above:
•	The payment made by EETPL to PQA does not constitute consideration for any taxable service;
•	EETPL has duly paid Sindh Sales Tax on its entire gross revenue, including amounts covering the royalty component;
